            <ArticleTitle>Ulcerated erythematous plaque on the right breast localized to the previously irradiated area.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">13030/qt4r93c8hr</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Radiation recall dermatitis (RRD) is an inflammatory reaction limited to previously irradiated areas and occurs following the subsequent administration of a drug. Herein, we present a patient with severe RRD associated with pain and necrosis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
